# PERMISSION-MODE-CASE: a profile whose `permission_mode` is `ASK`, which
# fx v0.0.16's parse reads as ask (`types.zig:2375-2382@481104fd`,
# `config_runtime.zig:1691`); then `/permissions` with fx's other spellings
# (`session_commands.zig:468`) and what each one saves (`@tagName`,
# `settings_store.zig:1053`). Each snap after a full-access change waits for
# the warning's four seconds to end.
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
seed p5-mode-case-upper.json
wait 2
snap start
type /permissions FULL-ACCESS
key Enter
until shown Full access
until gone Full access
snap full-access-upper
home full-access-upper
type /permissions Auto
key Enter
wait 1
snap auto-cap
type /permissions Full Access
key Enter
wait 1
snap full-access-space
home end
